---
layout: layout.njk
---


#hero
  .two-column
    %div
    
      %h1
        .span Pick-a-Pic
      %p
        Build
        %strong functional communication skills
        \ with an iPad app that is
        %strong easy to personalize
        \ for your learners.

    %div

      .video-frame
        %video{ autoplay: true, muted: true, loop: true }
          %source{ src: "/assets/video/speak-light.mp4", type: "video/mp4" }

.one-column
  %h2
    Made for
    %strong your
    \ pictures

  %p
    Motivate your learner by using pictures of the exact things they want.
    %br.wide-only
    With only a few taps, pictures can be imported from:
  
  %ul#import-list
    %li the Photos app
    %li the camera
    %li the Files app
    %li copied from the web
    %li text or emoji
    %li our gallery of examples

.two-column
  %div
    .video-frame
      %video{ autoplay: true, muted: true, loop: true }
        %source{ src: "/assets/video/arrange-light.mp4", type: "video/mp4" }
  %div
    %p
      Tap pictures in your library to add them to a page. Pictues arrange themselves automatically and can be rearranged by dragging.

.two-column.two-column-reverse
  %div
    .video-frame
      %video{ autoplay: true, muted: true, loop: true }
        %source{ src: "/assets/video/import-light.mp4", type: "video/mp4" }
  %div  
    %p
      TKTK import picture

%script{ type: "text/javascript", src: "/scripts/hero.js" }